  "changelog": "Version 1.0.6 of enhanced-permissions brings a robust permission and memory management system for OpenClaw.\n\n- Adds 4-level advanced permission system with auditing and trusted session features.\n- Integrates memory management with auto-decay, hot/cold separation, and smart recall.\n- Provides built-in version control: auto-versioning, history, rollback, and diff tools.\n- Features auto-organization: deduplication, tagging, expiration marking, and classification.\n- Includes intelligent suggestions via context analysis, keyword/entity extraction, and topic classification.\n- Delivers a full-featured knowledge graph module for entity-relation management and path reasoning.\n- Demonstrates 100% pass rate in 34 comprehensive tests, covering multiple real-world scenarios.",
